OL,3,AWestminster's time is coming to an end,
OL,4,AWelsh, Scottish, Northern Irish leaders
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut while Scotland's John Swinney and
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland's Michelle O'Neill
OL,9,Fcalled for referendums at a joint press
OL,10,Fconference, Wales' Rhun ap Iorwerth
OL,11,Frefused to give a timetable for one in
OL,12,Fhis country.
OL,14,FSinn Fein president Mary Lou McDonald
OL,15,Falso attended.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
